Root cause:
The bug was caused by the potential duplication of field names in shard requests when multiple "fl" (field list) parameters were used. This could lead to incorrect query results, as the system might not handle the same field being requested multiple times properly. The patch ensures that field names are checked for duplication before being added to the request parameters, thus preventing any unintended behavior due to duplicate fields.
